<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara 30-day bill average yield at 6.484 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara 30-day bill average yield at 6.484 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's central bank said it accepted bids at an average yield of 6.484 percent at its auction of 30-day Bank Negara bills for 500 million ringgit.</p>
<p>At the previous auction of 30-day Bank Negara bills for a similar amount on January 21, the central bank accepted bids at an average yield of 6.564 percent.</p>
<p>Bank Negara said the bids accepted were in the high/low range of 6.499/380 percent against 6.580/488 previously.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
